@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5091

### Subir un PDF de multa
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/pdf/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pdf"; filename="multa.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./multa.pdf
--Boundary--

### Subir un ZIP con varios PDFs
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/pdf/uploadzip
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="zip"; filename="multas.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./multas.zip
--Boundary--

### Ping
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/pdf/ping
Accept: application/json

###
